said Dub page
# Drift Hold, and Evolve and Motion to known values
spin K4 20
wait 300
said Drift Hold
spin K2 -100
wait 300
said Evolve 0
spin K3 100
wait 300
said Motion 100
# WHERE: everything again (the chord held now)
where
said Dub page: Filter Off, Evolve 0, Motion 100, Drift Hold. Piece Basic, F Dorian, tempo 92, resting
where
said , held. Section 
